          "en": "and multiply it with 100.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 30.99,
          "end": 34.443,
          "en": "So that in the end I get a score between zero and 100.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 36.48,
          "end": 40.083,
